    "title": "Major bridge joint seal work on Interstate 5 at end of May expected to cause delays, traffic backups - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Will Anderson ,\n4 hours ago TEHAMA COUNTY, Calif. - Caltrans says that crews will begin work on a major bridge joint seal work on Interstate 5 after Memorial Day weekend at Cottonwood Creek Bridge. The bridge, which is located around 15 miles south of Redding near the Shasta/Tehama County line, will have crews performing work over a month-long period. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
